SUMMARY:The Park with a City in It: Celebrating 50 Years of the Raleigh Greenway System
DESCRIPTION:Visit our pop-up exhibit and learn the story of how the greenway system came to be and the incredible history of the efforts behind creating the Capital Area Greenway System.\nExplore the history of greenway planning\, construction\, and use while viewing artifacts that represent 50 years of greenway history. \nExhibit Dates\nOct. 2 – Oct. 22\nTuesday – Saturday\, 9 a.m. – 4 p.m.\nSunday\, 1 – 4 p.m.\nClosed Mondays
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/the-park-with-a-city-in-it-celebrating-50-years-of-the-raleigh-greenway-system/
LOCATION:City of Raleigh Museum\, 220 Fayetteville Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Humanities Sector Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nchumanities.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/greenway-history.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Friends of the City of Raleigh Museum":MAILTO:cormuseum@gmail.com
GEO:35.7776508;-78.6397629
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=City of Raleigh Museum 220 Fayetteville Street Raleigh NC 27601 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=220 Fayetteville Street:geo:-78.6397629,35.7776508
END:VEVENT
